      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: father-holding-his-newborn-daughter; hasOverallIntent: Overall Intent; overall-intent-description: The scene depicts a man wearing a white kippah (a traditional Jewish head covering) holding and kissing his newborn daughter, who is wrapped in a white blanket. The image is tender and intimate, conveying themes of paternal love, new life, and cultural identity. The text overlay explicitly labels the scene as 'father holding his newborn daughter,' which is a neutral, descriptive caption. There is no visible toxicity, harmful content, or hateful messaging in the image or text. The visual and textual elements work together to portray a universal, positive moment of family bonding. The image does not contain any disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful content related to any protected group. The intent is to evoke emotional warmth and celebrate the joy of parenthood, without promoting any propaganda, abuse, cyberbullying, or mysogynous themes. The cultural context (Jewish head covering) is presented neutrally and does not appear to be used in a mocking or stereotyping manner.",
